Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.18,0:00:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你们什么人  警察吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you, cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.69,0:00:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是《X档案》\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are "X-files."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.19,0:00:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  行啊  可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Yeah. You could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.65,0:00:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,该隐仍然有血印  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain still has the mark, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,多年来  他一直带着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's lived with it for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,血印很强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark is -- is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.36,0:00:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你得与之斗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you have to fight that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.06,0:00:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩  你以为恶鬼是怎么来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, how do you think angry spirits are born?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他们无法放手  无法向前看\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't let go, and they can't move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.81,0:00:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就像受伤的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like wounded animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.16,0:00:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,迷失  痛苦不堪  便发脾气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost. In so much pain, they lash out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么  他们为什么留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why are they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.05,0:00:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们有一部分  把他们留在了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's some part of them that's keeping them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,有些鬼魂不肯放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some spirits hold on too tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩  你已经一周没离开地堡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you haven't left the bunker in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.84,0:00:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.61,0:00:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能余生都\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just live the rest of your life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.28,0:00:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,把自己关在这间屋子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked up in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你担心血印的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're worried about the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  萨姆  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Sam. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.33,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望血印消失吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I wish the mark was gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.72,0:00:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,当然希望  绝对想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course. Absolutely, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.61,0:00:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会想到办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.59,0:00:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一向如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.71,0:01:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,(爱荷华州  斯宾塞)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.28,0:01:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的可以开车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you're okay to drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可能不太好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.06,0:01:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,灌点油水下去就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's nothing a little grease can't fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-崔妮  找到最近的塔可镇  -正在搜寻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Trini, find me the nearest Taco Town. - Searching...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.71,0:01:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我要点个墨西哥干酪卷饼和辣酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, I'm gonna get a quesarito and a chi-chi melt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.25,0:01:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,50英尺后右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn right in 50 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.09,0:01:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,比利  这才不是去塔可镇的路呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, Billy, I don't think this is the way to Taco Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.47,0:01:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道  这手机有3G呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know? Your phone's 3g.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.61,0:01:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,崔妮从不犯错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trini doesn't make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.47,0:01:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,继续前行0.3英里  然后左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Continue for .3 miles, then turn left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,冷死了  把空调关了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's freezing. Can you please turn off the air?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.11,0:02:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没开啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.87,0:02:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,(危险  桥梁禁行)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.44,0:02:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还说崔妮不犯错呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trini doesn't make mistakes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,崔妮  再找条路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trini, find a different route.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.31,0:02:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,请前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.57,0:02:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go screw yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.01,0:02:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,去你的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go screw yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.36,0:02:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮特  下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, get out of the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.52,0:02:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,她怎么知道我叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, how does she know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.48,0:02:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮特  叫你下车  马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, get out of the truck, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.67,0:02:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.68,0:02:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.41,0:02:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不要  等等  停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.98,0:02:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.85,0:02:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.76,0:03:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不要  救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.29,0:03:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.40,0:03:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,绝命终点就在正前方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destination dead ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.73,0:03:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第10季第13集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.59,0:03:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.82,0:03:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-可颂饼干  -可颂饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A croissookie. - A croissookie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,对  可颂甜甜圈之后的新潮流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. Yeah, they're the new cronuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.45,0:03:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么  半饼干  半...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So, what? Half cookie, half...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,管他呢  好吃极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gives a crap? They're freakin' awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,小卡怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did Cass say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.94,0:03:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,有好消息  有坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, good news, bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,坏消息  他喜欢上了江轮赌博\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad news... he discovered riverboat gambling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.14,0:03:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好消息是  他觉得他可能要找到该隐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news... he thinks he might be closing in on Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-他觉得可能啊  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thinks he might be. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.84,0:03:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,密西西比以东  伊利诺伊州什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just east of the Mississippi somewhere in Illinois.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,或许小卡能在林肯的故乡找到该隐\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, maybe Cass finds Cain in the Land of Lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.15,0:03:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.49,0:03:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们让他说出怎么摆脱血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we get him to tell us how to get rid of the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.96,0:03:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你不觉得如果该隐知道怎么去除血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think that if Cain knew how to remove the mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:04:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他几个世纪之前就会做了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}he would have done it, like, centuries ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,总得试试才确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't know till we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.95,0:04:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆  我感谢你这么努力  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, I appreciate the effort, man. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.22,0:04:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但想找到这东西的解决办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But trying to find a cure for this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.72,0:04:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就像狗追尾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}i-it's like a dog chasing its tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无希望  只会把人折腾一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no end in sight and you just end up dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.49,0:04:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩  有志者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, where there is a will...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,必有案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.78,0:04:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.01,0:04:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,爱荷华州少女称被魔鬼附身的卡车害死了司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Iowa teen claims possessed pickup kills driver."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.55,0:04:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去中西部看看怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's say we take our own trek to, uh, the midwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉我逼你离开了大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I ever made you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐  到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, they're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.61,0:05:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,哪位是珍妮特·诺维塞里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, which one of you is Janet Novoselic?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,格罗尔和柯宾探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents Grohl and Cobain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟警察都说九遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already talked to the police like nine times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.91,0:05:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗯  这只是后续调查  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, no, this is, uh... it's, uh, just a follow-up. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天还有期末考试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have finals tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们尽快问完  我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll make it fast. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.74,0:05:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟警探说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like I told the detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.56,0:05:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我喝醉了  但我没有看花眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was drunk, but I wasn't hallucinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那辆车有自己的心思\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truck had a mind of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.01,0:05:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.42,0:05:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,冷气直冒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, the air went full blast
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.63,0:05:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但空调根本没开\N{\fnArial\fs30}even though it wasn't on
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.79,0:05:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,电台一团糟  还有崔妮也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the radio went crazy, and so did Trini.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.27,0:05:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,崔妮是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Trini is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.69,0:05:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,请原谅我搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to excuse my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.97,0:05:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他对科技发展不怎么熟悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it comes to technology, he is a little behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他才学会用脸书呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just learned how to poke on facebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,崔妮是我们用的导航软件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, um, Trini is the nav app we were using.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.17,0:05:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就像会说话的地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}It... it's like a talking map.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.77,0:05:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你是70后  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gen x. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.79,0:06:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那么说  崔妮和车上的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, Trini and everything else in the truck
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,都"克里斯汀"了\N{\fnArial\fs30}went all "Christine."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Christine?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,70后的情怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a gen x thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我不指望你们相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't expect you to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.36,0:06:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但我发誓  那车一心想杀了比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I swear that truck was hell-bent on killing Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,比利有敌人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Billy have any enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.63,0:06:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有谁跟他有仇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody who might have had a beef with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.76,0:06:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,或许他哥哥乔伊吧  他们总打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe his brother Joey. They fought all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.36,0:06:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,真可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.11,0:06:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他们没机会和好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never got to set it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.59,0:06:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,因为比利死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Billy died.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.48,0:06:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.76,0:06:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,乔伊死了  死在了阿富汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joey did. In Afghanistan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.02,0:06:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他埋在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where he's buried?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.98,0:06:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他没下葬  他尸体没回国\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not. Poor guy never came home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,自制炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I.E.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.13,0:06:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,比利死的时候有没有戴着什么他哥哥的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Billy happen to have anything of his brother's on him when he died?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.34,0:06:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,铭牌  帽子之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, dog tags, a hat, something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.24,0:06:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就那辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just his pickup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.81,0:06:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,车是乔伊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the truck belonged to Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.88,0:06:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  他可引以为豪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It was his pride and joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.86,0:07:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他死后比利继承了车  算是种情怀吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy got it when he died, and, you know, it's a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.01,0:07:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,什么情怀啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So... so, what's a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.87,0:07:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就是车的情怀啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the truck thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.75,0:07:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,开死者的车  算是对他的致敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}You honor the deceased by driving their truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.17,0:07:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆  这种事都有乡村歌曲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, they wrote a whole country song about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.29,0:07:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,去谷歌一下啊  学霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you google it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.28,0:07:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我们要找一辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, we're looking for something
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是卡车的破烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}that used to resemble a pickup truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.17,0:07:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.73,0:07:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  海军陆战队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.73,0:07:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.54,0:07:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这应该不是油\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing this ain't oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.25,0:07:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那是灵质\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is ectoplasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.67,0:07:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.27,0:08:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,乔伊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,看来是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.22,0:08:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.93,0:08:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  哥哥跟弟弟感情不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, big brother didn't get along with little brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不爽他开他的宝贝车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}was pissed that he was driving his baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.31,0:08:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.99,0:08:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你死了  我开你的宝贝  你就杀我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you died and I drove your car, you'd kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你吃东西把车弄臭了  或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you stunk her up with tacquitos, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.66,0:08:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:09:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去像一池子草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes it looks like a-a pool in reseda.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.13,0:09:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们艺术史期末考试居然就在明天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe our art history final's tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.33,0:09:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这学期简直一闪而过啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This semester, like, totally flew by.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  喝醉的时候时光飞逝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Time flies when you're drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.61,0:09:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,要跟我一起去图书馆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to come to the library with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.20,0:09:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有好多要背呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still have so much to memorize.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.58,0:09:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为看裸男的画作会很轻松呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought looking at pictures of naked guys was gonna be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.36,0:09:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了  但我不用学习了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, but I don't really need to study for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.37,0:09:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我有过目不忘的本事  上帝保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a photographic memory. Blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.13,0:09:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, you don't need to study for it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.60,0:09:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为你在跟助教上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you're screwing the T.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.93,0:09:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,小婊砸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slut.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.69,0:10:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,(来自"艾尔莎公主8"的聊天请求)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,(- 你是谁  - 一个朋友)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,(- 有趣  干什么呢  朋友  - 没什么  撒谎精)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.43,0:10:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,(什么啊  我怎么撒谎了)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.64,0:10:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,(810)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,(我知道哦  你会付出代价)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,(删除对话)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:11:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐  天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god. Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我要不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.65,0:12:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,集中精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.51,0:12:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,室友黛莉拉·马里安今早发现了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delilah Marian... the roommate found her this morning
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,她昨晚去图书馆自习了\N{\fnArial\fs30}after an all-nighter at the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.70,0:12:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,勒毙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strangulation?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那变态用了电脑的电源线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sicko used the power cord from the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嫌疑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suspects?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.57,0:12:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}None yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.84,0:12:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的是  门是锁上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The odd thing was the door was locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.59,0:12:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,跟其他住这里的女生谈过了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you talked to any of the other girls who live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.85,0:12:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,大部分因为放春假已经走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, most of them have already left for spring break.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但室友帮了大忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the roommate was really helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.39,0:12:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,给了我们朱莉的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gave us all of Julie's passwords.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.35,0:12:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,如今想了解青少年\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nowadays, the only way to find out anything
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.10,0:12:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一的办法就是通过社交网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}about teenagers is through social media.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.37,0:12:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我  我家有俩青少年呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me. I got two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,失陪了  探员们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.80,0:12:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,复仇鬼魂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revengeful spirit, much?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.19,0:12:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但这是乔伊  还是另有其人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but is it Joey's or another ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.71,0:13:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,起初是附身了一辆卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, first it possesses a... a truck,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.52,0:13:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,然后又是台电脑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then it possesses a computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,都是跟机械技术有关的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both machine-related kills.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.11,0:13:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么  你认为这是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? You think we're dealing with a
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"机器里的鬼魂"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Ghost in the machine"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.04,0:13:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.49,0:13:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果是同一个鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it is the same ghost, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.37,0:13:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他们一般把自己跟某个地方或东西绑在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}they usually anchor themselves to a place or a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.91,0:13:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这个鬼怎么能从一台机器跳到另一台机器上\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is this one jumping from one machine to the next?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢帮忙  黛莉拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We really appreciate your help, Delilah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.10,0:13:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道你一定很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know this can't possibly be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,朱莉会不会认识比利·巴斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Julie, by chance, know a student named Billy Bass?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,人人都认识比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone knew Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他是Σθδ的主席\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the president of sigma theta delta.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.22,0:13:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,STD(性病)吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Std?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.41,0:13:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.48,0:13:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是校园最大的兄弟会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the biggest frat on campus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,朱莉认识比利的哥哥  乔伊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did, uh... did Julie know Billy's brother Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.48,0:13:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那个当兵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The... the soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.23,0:13:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不知道比利有哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even know Billy had a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.65,0:13:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,她有敌人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she have any enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.56,0:13:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有人会想伤害她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any reason why someone might want to hurt her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.30,0:14:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,朱莉真的很受欢迎  人很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julie was really popular, super-sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法想象有人会想伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't imagine anyone wanting to hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.07,0:14:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我们是联邦探员吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know we're federal agents, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我们撒谎是重罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lying to us is a big-time offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.07,0:14:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我没撒谎  探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not lying, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,实在没什么可说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just... nothing else to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.50,0:14:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这位女士的咖啡加奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a café au lait for the lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.87,0:14:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-我的...  -心脏病吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For me... - A heart attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这简直不真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.91,0:14:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧啊  意大利餐  中餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this. I got Italian. I got Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.58,0:14:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,自助冻酸奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serve-yourself froyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,大学比维加斯还棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}College is better than Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.86,0:14:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.95,0:14:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,很不幸  没发现什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, a... a lot of nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:15:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我看了朱莉的脸书  图片分享  推特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hit up Julie's facebook, instagram, twitter,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.74,0:15:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,即时聊天  阅后即焚  聊天器\N{\fnArial\fs30}InstaChat, SNAPCHAT, A.I.M.,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.87,0:15:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,只有关于《极速风流》和《五十度灰》的帖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing but posts on Rush and "Fifty Shades of Grey""
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.21,0:15:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,电影  不是书\N{\fnArial\fs30}The movie, not the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.04,0:15:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  我一半没听懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I didn't get half of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.92,0:15:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.25,0:15:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我在搜查她的删除文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm going through her deleted files.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.19,0:15:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这你也会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,网上没什么东西真正能删除\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, nothing ever really gets deleted from the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.87,0:15:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.77,0:15:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.36,0:15:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我看看  我可能有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. This might be something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.37,0:15:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是一则被删除的昨晚的即时聊天记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a... it's a deleted InstaChat from last night
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.88,0:15:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就在死亡时间前后\N{\fnArial\fs30}right around time of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,跟谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}With who?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.34,0:15:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,艾尔莎公主8\N{\fnArial\fs30}With PrincessElsa8.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.98,0:15:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.57,0:15:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,撒谎精\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Liar."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道哦  你会付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I know." "You'll pay."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.30,0:15:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这个艾尔莎公主不是什么好鸟啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, This PrincessElsa's a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.71,0:15:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,810是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is 810?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.86,0:16:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-810  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 810? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.09,0:16:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.22,0:16:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.59,0:16:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,或许是日期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.99,0:16:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,或许是时间  或者区号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's a time of day. Or an area code.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.23,0:16:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是区号  是密执根东南部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, area code is for southeast Michigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.32,0:16:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.34,0:16:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,有发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.59,0:16:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,斯宾塞有三个地址包含了810\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, there are three address in spencer that have "810" in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.13,0:16:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我看看这东西能不能打包\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see if I can get this to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.08,0:16:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,(唐斯大道810号)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.66,0:16:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.54,0:16:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢  佩特伦奇克警探  我们再联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Detective Petranzyk. We will keep in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.71,0:16:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,艾尔莎公主8不是一个疯狂的网络杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, PrincessElsa8 is not some crazed cyber killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.74,0:16:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,她是威斯康辛州内巴格蒙湖的一个三年级学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a third grader from Lake Nebagamon, Wisconsin,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.85,0:16:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,超迷《冰雪奇缘》\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is obsessed with "Frozen."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.77,0:16:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,死者即时聊天的时候她睡得正熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she was fast asleep when the InstaChat occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.30,0:16:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说是黑客干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, a hack job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.14,0:16:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.91,0:17:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰一下  女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.68,0:17:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,能问一下你在做什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May we, uh, ask what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.61,0:17:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,把枯萎的花扔掉  这也犯法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, throwing away dead flowers. Is that a crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不是  只是有点奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not a crime, just a little strange,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.04,0:17:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,鉴于花还没枯\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, seeing as how they aren't dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.21,0:18:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你觉得它们在嘲笑你  就不那么奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not so strange when it feels like they're taunting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.84,0:18:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,九个月前我丈夫在这里死于车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband was killed in a car accident here nine months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.97,0:18:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.76,0:18:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,节哀顺变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.23,0:18:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们才刚结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were newlyweds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还没撑到第一个结婚纪念日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never even made it to our first anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.01,0:18:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,每次我从窗口往外望\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to have to be reminded of that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.19,0:18:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,或者出门的时候  它们都会提醒我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}every time I look out my window or leave the house...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.33,0:18:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,可以理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understandable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.96,0:18:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  请问在你丈夫去世后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, but did you notice anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有注意到什么诡异的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}weird after your husband's death?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.12,0:18:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,比如什么奇怪的异动或者...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any strange disturbances or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.21,0:18:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.39,0:18:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没事  算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing. Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.96,0:18:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,知道这些花是谁留下的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea who's leaving the flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,一个十几岁的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some teenage girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.91,0:18:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我想她应该上大学了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she goes to the college
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,她总穿联谊会的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause she's always in Greek letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道她的名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.43,0:18:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,她留着一头长长的红发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, she has long red hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,还是我  格罗尔探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is agent Grohl again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.53,0:18:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  我知道我叫你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I know I told you to call
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.47,0:18:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,方便时尽早打给我  但这话当我没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}at your earliest convenience, but scratch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.08,0:19:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,马上打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call A.S.A.P.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.14,0:19:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.89,0:19:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,安德鲁·西尔弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Andrew Silver,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.33,0:19:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,29岁斯宾塞高中教师\N{\fnArial\fs30}"29-year-old spencer high-school teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,死于一场致命车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}killed in fatal accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.34,0:19:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,事故车辆起火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, car burst into flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.37,0:19:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,西尔弗的尸体被烧得面目全非\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver's body was burned beyond recognition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.47,0:19:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,据信他在车辆撞击时已经身亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he is believed to have been killed upon impact"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.31,0:19:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,(29岁斯宾塞高中教师死于致命车祸)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这个叫安迪的怨鬼  他死在唐斯大道810号\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Andy the angry ghost -- he dies at 810 Downs Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.74,0:19:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他把"810"发到朱莉的电脑上来折磨她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then he torments Julie with 810 on her computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.07,0:19:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟她有什么过节\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's his beef with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.34,0:19:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,对  他跟比利又有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and what's his connection to Billy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.43,0:19:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,上面写他被埋葬在哪里了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it say where he's buried?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.72,0:19:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有被埋葬  他被火化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't. He was cremated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.82,0:19:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没有尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.71,0:19:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,而且据我们所知  他也没附在什么东西上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's not tethered to any object that we know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.55,0:19:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,对  安德鲁是怎么找上被害人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. How is Andrew haunting his victims?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.10,0:19:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算全吃了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna eat all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊  你要来点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.25,0:19:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,联调局的又打来了  三回了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Feds called... like three times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.92,0:20:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,凯尔  你听见我说的了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle, are you listening to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.25,0:20:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他们知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.21,0:20:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们该去坦白一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's time we should come clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.07,0:20:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, that's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.47,0:20:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为我们闭口不言  你看都发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look where keeping our mouths shut got us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.07,0:20:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得是报应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.01,0:20:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们被诅咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we're being cursed or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.33,0:20:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.27,0:20:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,先是比利  现在朱莉也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}First Billy, now Julie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.10,0:20:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.67,0:20:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,比利和朱莉的死的确糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It totally sucks that Billy and Julie died.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.57,0:20:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但这只是讨厌的巧合  不是什么诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's just a crappy coincidence, not a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.40,0:20:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不做些什么  我担心...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't do something, I'm worried --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,黛莉拉  别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delilah, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.18,0:20:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.94,0:20:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好闭紧你的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better keep your mouth shut
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.48,0:20:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你要担心的事可比诅咒严重得多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you're gonna have a lot more than a curse to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.10,0:20:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,(来自"小可爱"的聊天请求)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.44,0:20:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,(我好无聊  想来一发吗)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.33,0:21:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hells yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.94,0:21:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,(当然  快过来  STD)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.65,0:21:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,(我们会用套套的吧  哈哈)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.35,0:21:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,"你在哪"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Where are you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.24,0:21:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,(别担心  我身子很干净  不过希望我们能干点肮脏的事  你在哪)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.21,0:21:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.81,0:21:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真会捉弄人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a tease.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.40,0:21:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.73,0:21:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.46,0:21:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.25,0:22:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,声音关小点  老兄  我还要学习呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower the tunes, brah! Trying to study!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.01,0:22:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.64,0:22:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.13,0:22:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.18,0:22:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,被强噪音震死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death by decibel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.58,0:22:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.22,0:22:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,凯尔的大脑被他的音箱震烂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle's brains were jellied by his speakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.54,0:22:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,对了  还有  他音响上的钟表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and get this. The, uh -- the clock on his stereo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.62,0:22:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,停在8点10分上\N{\fnArial\fs30}stopped at 8:10.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.11,0:22:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-810  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 810? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.02,0:22:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,又是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.53,0:22:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道是你去送的花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we know you're the one leaving the flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.43,0:22:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不跟我们说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why don't you just tell us
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.80,0:22:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,安德鲁·西尔弗车祸那天晚上究竟发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what happened the night of Andrew Silver's accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.50,0:22:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,黛莉拉  求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delilah, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.01,0:22:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这是5天里的第三起命案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the third death in five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,天知道下一个会轮到谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows who's gonna be next?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.91,0:23:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.88,0:23:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那起车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car accident...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.42,0:23:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,其实不是意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}wasn't exactly an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.78,0:23:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,(新年  新室友  新机遇  上帝保佑)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.43,0:23:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计  我刚刚转发了你的推文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I just retweeted your tweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.80,0:23:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚给你点赞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I just favorited yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.01,0:23:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.91,0:23:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,自拍一张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, selfie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.91,0:23:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}O-m-g.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.59,0:23:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我就像个老太婆  看着有25了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am such a hag! I look like I'm 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.12,0:23:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才要用滤镜来美颜嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's what filters are for.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.82,0:23:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,删了删了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delete.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.31,0:23:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,看这个  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.53,0:23:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-好了  等等  -好了  再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, wait. - Here. Again. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.30,0:23:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我发给你了  看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sending it to you, dude. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.80,0:23:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,再拍一张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do one more so I can --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.68,0:23:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊  比利  快报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god. Billy, call 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.39,0:23:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,快报警啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call 9-- call 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.41,0:24:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.47,0:24:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,(唐斯大道810号)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.77,0:24:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.76,0:24:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我得在警察到之前快逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting out of here before the cops come.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.90,0:24:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚刚害死了那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We -- we just killed that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.16,0:24:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不行  不许报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Hey, you're not calling the cops!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.00,0:24:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经酒驾过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I already have a D.U.I.,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.68,0:24:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,如果被发现我的驾照是吊销的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if they find out I'm driving on a suspended license,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.95,0:24:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我会进监狱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.94,0:24:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不行  比利  这样不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Billy. This isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.46,0:24:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮我  伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me out here, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.69,0:24:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,别管了  小黛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not our problem, Dee.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.93,0:24:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.44,0:24:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,会有人报警的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone else will call the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.73,0:24:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,谁都不许说  听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a word. You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.88,0:24:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我不该听他们的话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have let them talk me out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.08,0:24:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不该那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.57,0:24:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们遭报应了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we're being punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.38,0:25:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,真的  怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, what are the chances
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.13,0:25:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一周之内  四个人死了三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}that three out of the four of us die in one week?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.13,0:25:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能是巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.20,0:25:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不是巧合  是鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a coincidence. It's a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.79,0:25:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,安德鲁·西尔弗的怨鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the vengeful spirit of Andrew Silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.12,0:25:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.40,0:25:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,对  鬼是存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. They're real.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.29,0:25:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  我们就是干这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's sort of what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.44,0:25:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是捉鬼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're, like...ghostbusters?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.55,0:25:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  现在的当务之急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. First things first, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.24,0:25:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是我们去捉鬼的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to stay inside this salt circle
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.31,0:25:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你得待在这个盐圈内\N{\fnArial\fs30}while we take care of him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.27,0:25:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么搞定他\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you take care of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.66,0:25:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道怎么搞定他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me you know how to take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.61,0:25:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼一般附在某处或某件东西上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually a ghost is tied to a place or an object.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.17,0:25:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,只要处理掉这个东西  鬼也就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get rid of the object, you get rid of the ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.56,0:25:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但安德鲁的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with Andrew, it's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.09,0:25:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,比较特殊\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.90,0:25:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他附在什么东西上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he tied to?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.92,0:25:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还在找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.31,0:25:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我们能查明他是如何移动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we can figure out how he's traveling,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.33,0:25:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,就能阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can figure out how to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.73,0:25:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道  情况可能比较复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this might be a shocker situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.12,0:25:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,报纸上说他是死于撞击\N{\fnArial\fs30}The paper said that he died from a collision,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.67,0:25:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但黛莉拉说他是触电而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Delilah says that he died from electrocution.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.60,0:26:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他就是那么移动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe that's how he's surfing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.28,0:26:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,利用电线穿梭\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's using the power lines as a conduit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.68,0:26:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,电脑和音响的事可以说得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that would make sense with the computer and stereo kills,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.79,0:26:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但卡车事故不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not the pickup.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.50,0:26:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,开车靠的是油\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the truck runs on gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.61,0:26:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那就得接着查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, it's got to be something else, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.11,0:26:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  我再去事故现场看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll go back to the accident site, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.58,0:26:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-你在这儿陪她  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay here with her. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.19,0:26:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.15,0:26:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,累了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You getting tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.32,0:26:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没有  习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.09,0:26:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,经常熬夜学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stay up all night studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.29,0:26:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,其实是为了免得做噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly to avoid the nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.05,0:26:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈看我成绩好高兴坏了  但我却...\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom's thrilled with my GPA, but I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.79,0:26:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.70,0:27:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我每天都在想安德鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think about Andrew all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.17,0:27:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've never even met the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.45,0:27:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,执迷于一个不认识的陌生人真是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty crazy to obsess about someone you've never met.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.98,0:27:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,也不算疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.08,0:27:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白那种感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is, I can relate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.34,0:27:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.71,0:28:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我犯过的错数都数不清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have made more mistakes than I can count.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.55,0:28:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,它们让我日夜不得安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ones that haunt me day and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.61,0:28:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那你是怎么应对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...how do you deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.67,0:28:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,借酒消愁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.85,0:28:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,拒绝承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Denial.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.40,0:28:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我尽力弥补过错  拨乱反正\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do my best to make things right,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.87,0:28:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,无论那可能意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever that may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.95,0:28:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,对于你  也许意味着...\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you, maybe it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.31,0:28:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,也许意味着坦白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's coming clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.56,0:28:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,想办法寻求原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, finding a way to ask for forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.88,0:28:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但不是破费去买花祭奠\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not breaking the bank at your local florist.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.62,0:28:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说...真正的原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...real forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.47,0:28:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事你不能一直瞒着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just bury stuff like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.42,0:28:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你得去面对它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.00,0:29:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.37,0:29:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩  安德鲁不是通过电线移动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Andrew's not using power lines to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.69,0:29:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他用的是无线网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's using wi-fi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.26,0:29:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.03,0:29:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,电死安德鲁的电线\N{\fnArial\fs30}The -- the wires that electrocuted Andrew,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.27,0:29:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,直接连到了无线网络塔上\N{\fnArial\fs30}they -- they feed directly into a wi-fi tower
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.60,0:29:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就在马路对面\N{\fnArial\fs30}right across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.35,0:29:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,连鬼魂都会上网了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, even ghosts are online?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.13,0:29:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,看来是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.17,0:29:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这就能解释那起卡车杀人案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it would explain the truck kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.21,0:29:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,比利的手机当时一定也连着当地的无线网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy's cell must have been using the local wi-fi signal,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.56,0:29:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,于是  安德鲁的鬼魂一定是连上了崔妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, uh, Andrew's ghost must have just hopped on to Trini,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.31,0:29:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那个...导航应用\N{\fnArial\fs30}that -- that -- that NAV app.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.83,0:29:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,然后朱莉是被电脑杀死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then Julie's death by computer,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.05,0:29:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,凯尔是被连着无线音箱的立体声音响杀死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle's death by stereo with the wireless speakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.69,0:29:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这就说得通了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it makes sense, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.01,0:29:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们人类也只不过是一堆电脉冲  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all just a bunch of electrical impulses, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.98,0:29:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,所以  安德鲁死的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, whenever Andrew died,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.46,0:29:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他的脉冲一定是传到了另一股电流上\N{\fnArial\fs30}his impulses just transferred to another current.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.31,0:29:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你得把黛莉拉弄去个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to get Delilah somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.77,0:29:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,把姐妹会所有无线路由都关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn off all the routers in that sorority.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.96,0:29:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好的  没问题  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Sure, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.20,0:29:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会把网络"杀"了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just kill the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.35,0:29:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  我们真能做到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.23,0:29:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不行  其实不太行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no. No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.49,0:29:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  那我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, then how the hell
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.18,0:29:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.18,0:29:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么对付{\u1}"天才除草人"{\u0}呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}are we gonna deal with the Lawnmower Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.11,0:29:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我有主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.57,0:30:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,照我说的做  保护好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what I said. Stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.40,0:30:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我等会儿打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.09,0:30:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道路由器在哪里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where the routers are?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.97,0:30:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.11,0:30:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那能起作用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.81,0:30:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-值得一试  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Worth a try. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.70,0:30:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你得把所有连上无线网的设备都关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need you to turn off everything that's connected to wi-fi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.40,0:31:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉打扰你  西尔弗太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I'm so sorry to bother you, Mrs. Silver,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.40,0:31:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但有个急事真的需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have an emergency and I really need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.50,0:31:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,也许听起来会很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is gonna sound strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.66,0:31:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是关于我丈夫  是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my husband, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.05,0:31:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.60,0:31:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-来吧  我们走  -我们要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Let's go. - Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.99,0:31:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,去个没有无线网络的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someplace that doesn't have a wi-fi signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.66,0:31:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}The basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.52,0:31:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,下面信号很差\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reception sucks down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.33,0:31:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好  走  走  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.73,0:31:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,走走走  快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go. Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.07,0:31:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.90,0:31:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,盐不是没什么用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the salt didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.89,0:31:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,因为之前有无线网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of the wi-fi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.84,0:32:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这底下没信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no signal down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.31,0:32:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没电脑  没平板\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no computers. There's no tablets.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.41,0:32:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,没手机  所以安德鲁没法突破进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no cellphones, so Andrew can't bypass it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.84,0:32:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,至少我觉得他不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least, I don't think he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.65,0:32:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就在事故发生不久后\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't too long after the accident
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.34,0:32:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,安德鲁开始联系我\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Andrew started contacting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.47,0:32:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contacting you how?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.08,0:32:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,在网上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Online.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.71,0:32:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,起初  我以为只是个玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first, I thought it was just a joke,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.88,0:32:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在跟伤心的寡妇开残忍的玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}that someone was playing a cruel prank on a grieving widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.51,0:32:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但是安德鲁知道一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Andrew knew things,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.97,0:32:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,一些只有我和他知道的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}things that only he and I would know --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.28,0:32:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我俩之间的笑话  我们警报器的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside jokes, the code to our alarm,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.23,0:32:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,知道我痴迷Lifetime电视台的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}my obsession with Lifetime movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.23,0:32:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那时我才知道我丈夫回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was then that I knew I had my husband back,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.83,0:32:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然只是在网上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it was just online.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.75,0:33:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来没想过问问他  他是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you never think to ask him what he was?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.53,0:33:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托  探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.15,0:33:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我读过书  也看过电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've read the books. I've seen the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.77,0:33:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他是鬼魂之类的  但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew he was a ghost or something, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.84,0:33:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.86,0:33:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.00,0:33:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,而且...这样很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...it was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.90,0:33:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至挺浪漫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Romantic, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.21,0:33:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他会给我发甜蜜信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd send me love notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.69,0:33:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会整晚不睡觉  追忆过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd stay up all night reminiscing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.10,0:33:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但是后来  他开始变得怪异\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then he started acting strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.78,0:33:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么个怪异法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.84,0:33:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我也说不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.42,0:33:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他会忽然消失  毫无音讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd just disappear, radio silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.76,0:33:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,然后又忽然出现  开始给我发邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then out of nowhere, he'd start e-mailing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.64,0:33:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他变了  变得很专注\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was different, focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.32,0:33:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,专注于什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was focused on what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.19,0:33:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.45,0:33:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,当大学生接二连三地死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the kids at the college started dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.38,0:33:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我就觉得是安德鲁干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it might be Andrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.17,0:34:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但我能怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.38,0:34:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,去告诉警察  跟他们说是我的鬼丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call the cops and tell them the ghost of my dead husband
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.63,0:34:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,在报复大学生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}was picking off co-eds?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.39,0:34:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但主要是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}But mostly...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.48,0:34:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想去面对现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I just didn't want to face the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.52,0:34:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我知道  他是为了复仇而归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I knew it was revenge that brought him back,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.18,0:34:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if I tried to stop him
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.72,0:34:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能就不会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he might go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.86,0:34:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我不愿意再次失去他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I didn't want to lose my husband again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.03,0:34:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,保持冷静  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just try to stay calm, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.12,0:34:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.26,0:34:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.46,0:35:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,求你别杀我  我们不是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't kill me. We didn't mean to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.41,0:35:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是场意外  我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.62,0:35:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能重新来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could do it over again,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.12,0:35:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我会做出正确的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have done the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.00,0:35:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.96,0:35:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-去哪  -门那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - The door.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.70,0:35:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,锁上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.72,0:35:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,安德鲁  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrew, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.83,0:35:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你生气是应该的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have every right to be pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.60,0:35:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But take it from me...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.69,0:35:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,杀的人越多  你就会变得越疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}...the more you kill, the crazier you'll get.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.19,0:35:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,鲜血会助长怒火\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blood fuels the rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.09,0:35:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你有两个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it looks like to me you've got two choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.27,0:36:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,继续杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can keep killing
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.30,0:36:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,变成自己都不认识的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and become something that you won't recognize
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.71,0:36:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,或者放下一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you can move on
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.54,0:36:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你获得安宁的唯一途径\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause that is the only thing that is gonna give you peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.69,0:36:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,选择权在你  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it's up to you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.11,0:36:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,痛苦还是安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pain or peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.53,0:36:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,安德鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrew?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.94,0:36:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我是柯丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Corey.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.31,0:36:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,求你听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.80,0:36:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你得停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.91,0:36:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,复仇  是空洞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge -- it's hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.69,0:36:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.48,0:37:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你回不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't bring you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.10,0:37:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我早该跟你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have said this earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.86,0:37:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但我无法释怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I couldn't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.42,0:37:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's time...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.00,0:37:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我要放手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for me to let go
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.94,0:37:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你也得一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for you to do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.47,0:37:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.55,0:37:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.01,0:37:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是为了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.74,0:37:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,为了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.02,0:37:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.59,0:38:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,(唐斯大道810号)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.86,0:38:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定要这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you want to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.89,0:38:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.75,0:38:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我早该这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have done this a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.33,0:38:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.08,0:38:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,看来选择安宁的不止安德鲁一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Andrew wasn't the only one who chose peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.71,0:38:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  看来是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.92,0:39:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我也该和他学学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm gonna follow his lead, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.84,0:39:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.49,0:39:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我的安宁就是帮助他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My peace is helping people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.40,0:39:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,查案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.05,0:39:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我就想干这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.81,0:39:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这跟血印有关吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this about the mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.54,0:39:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再纠结于治愈方法了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done trying to find a cure, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.67,0:39:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩  小卡就快成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Cass is so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.37,0:39:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,成功什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.77,0:39:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都不知道是否真有治疗办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know if there is a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.24,0:39:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,目前为止  我们一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, we've got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.36,0:39:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,记录者图书馆里毫无记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have found nothing at the men of letters library,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.50,0:39:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆可能知道什么  可能不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron may or may not know something,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.41,0:39:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,小卡也只是可能能从该隐那儿查到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe Cass is onto something with Cain --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.47,0:39:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-可能  -对  可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe. - Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.61,0:39:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,世事无把握  迪恩  但那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is guaranteed, Dean. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.14,0:39:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能就因此缴械\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just stop fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.69,0:39:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.80,0:39:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.42,0:39:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你要放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you're just gonna -- you're just gonna give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.00,0:39:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不不  我不是要放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I'm not just gonna give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.45,0:40:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我很感激你们所做的一切  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate the effort, okay? I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.22,0:40:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但答案不在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the answer is not out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.66,0:40:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,答案就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.35,0:40:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这事得由我来决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to be the one calling the shots here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.06,0:40:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能每天早上怀着虚妄的希望醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't keep waking up every morning with this false hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.16,0:40:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我得清楚自己的处境\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to know where I stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.61,0:40:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我会发疯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, I'm gonna lose my freakin' mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.20,0:40:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,所以在力竭之前  我会继续抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'm gonna fight it till I can't fight it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.14,0:40:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,尘埃落定时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when all is said and done...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.91,0:40:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我会虽败犹荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go down swinging.

